# Attribution

Do not list Cursor (or any AI/tool) as author, co-author, or collaborator.

- Git commits: no `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or similar) trailer
- README, credits, license, GitHub: only the human author
- Do not add Cursor as a GitHub collaborator
